{"id":"47e3f5d82f726210","group":"72","path":"72/72-cor-structured-subtree-well-order.md","title":"结构化子树的良序","display":"cor-structured-subtree-well-order — 结构化子树的良序","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-cor-structured-subtree-well-order","aliases":["72-cor-structured-subtree-well-order"],"display":"cor-structured-subtree-well-order — 结构化子树的良序","chapter":"III","depends_on":["[[72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion]]","[[72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III Cor.2.9; print155; PDF167","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_status":"checked","source_proof_status":"checked","proof_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-cor-structured-subtree-well-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-cor-structured-subtree-well-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-structured-subtree-well-order — 结构化子树的良序"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c2a9f766f12bca93\" href=\"?note=c2a9f766f12bca93\" title=\"72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion\">72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f09cae20e23b713\" href=\"?note=3f09cae20e23b713\" title=\"72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain\">72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III Cor.2.9; print155; PDF167"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega_s,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\prec,\\preccurlyeq,\\alpha[n]\">\\(\\Omega_s,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\prec,\\preccurlyeq,\\alpha[n]\\)</span> 及前驱穷尽见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c2a9f766f12bca93\" href=\"?note=c2a9f766f12bca93\" title=\"72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion\">72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion</a>；有限链性质见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3f09cae20e23b713\" href=\"?note=3f09cae20e23b713\" title=\"72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain\">72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\Omega_s\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0\\}\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\Omega_s\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0\\}\\)</span>；下式定义集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^\\prec_\\alpha\">\\(D^\\prec_\\alpha\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D^\\prec_\\alpha\\coloneqq\\{\\beta\\in\\Omega:\\beta\\prec\\alpha\\}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\alpha[n].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D^\\prec_\\alpha\\coloneqq\\{\\beta\\in\\Omega:\\beta\\prec\\alpha\\}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\alpha[n].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0\\in D^\\prec_\\alpha,\\qquad\\forall\\beta\\in D^\\prec_\\alpha\\ (\\beta=\\mathbf0\\lor\\mathbf0\\prec\\beta),\\qquad\\forall\\beta\\in D^\\prec_\\alpha\\ (\\mathsf S\\beta\\preccurlyeq\\alpha).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf0\\in D^\\prec_\\alpha,\\qquad\\forall\\beta\\in D^\\prec_\\alpha\\ (\\beta=\\mathbf0\\lor\\mathbf0\\prec\\beta),\\qquad\\forall\\beta\\in D^\\prec_\\alpha\\ (\\mathsf S\\beta\\preccurlyeq\\alpha).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\beta,\\gamma\\in D^\\prec_\\alpha\\ (\\beta=\\gamma\\lor\\beta\\prec\\gamma\\lor\\gamma\\prec\\beta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\beta,\\gamma\\in D^\\prec_\\alpha\\ (\\beta=\\gamma\\lor\\beta\\prec\\gamma\\lor\\gamma\\prec\\beta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall A\\subseteq D^\\prec_\\alpha\\ \\left(A\\ne\\varnothing\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\exists\\beta\\in A\\ \\forall\\gamma\\in A\\ \\neg(\\gamma\\prec\\beta)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall A\\subseteq D^\\prec_\\alpha\\ \\left(A\\ne\\varnothing\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\exists\\beta\\in A\\ \\forall\\gamma\\in A\\ \\neg(\\gamma\\prec\\beta)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Corollary 2.9，印刷 p.155 / PDF p.167。特别核对原页的后继结论是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta+1\\preccurlyeq\\alpha\">\\(\\beta+1\\preccurlyeq\\alpha\\)</span>，允许等号；没有把它误写成严格小于。</p>\n<p>证明：任意两个严格子树分别属于某个有限前驱集；由递增穷尽定理可放入同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha[n]\">\\(\\alpha[n]\\)</span>，再用有限链引理得到线性。严格子树关系本身良基，限制到这个集合仍良基，故线性序为良序。任何非零树都含零子树：对树作归纳，后继分支看直接前驱，极限分支看第零子树；这也给出零为最小元。</p>\n<p>最后验证后继闭包。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 归纳；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha=\\mathsf S\\delta\">\\(\\alpha=\\mathsf S\\delta\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta=\\delta\">\\(\\beta=\\delta\\)</span> 时等号成立，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\prec\\delta\">\\(\\beta\\prec\\delta\\)</span> 时用对子树的归纳假设。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha=\\mathsf L((\\alpha_i)_i)\">\\(\\alpha=\\mathsf L((\\alpha_i)_i)\\)</span>，选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\preccurlyeq\\alpha_i\">\\(\\beta\\preccurlyeq\\alpha_i\\)</span>；结构化条件给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_i\\prec\\alpha_{i+1}\">\\(\\alpha_i\\prec\\alpha_{i+1}\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\prec\\alpha_{i+1}\">\\(\\beta\\prec\\alpha_{i+1}\\)</span>，对子树用归纳假设得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S\\beta\\preccurlyeq\\alpha_{i+1}\\prec\\alpha\">\\(\\mathsf S\\beta\\preccurlyeq\\alpha_{i+1}\\prec\\alpha\\)</span>。并集等式来自穷尽定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion","status":"resolved","id":"c2a9f766f12bca93","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain","status":"resolved","id":"3f09cae20e23b713","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion","status":"resolved","id":"c2a9f766f12bca93","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Omega_s,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\prec,\\preccurlyeq,\\alpha[n]$ 及前驱穷尽见 [[72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion]]；有限链性质见 [[72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain","status":"resolved","id":"3f09cae20e23b713","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Omega_s,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\prec,\\preccurlyeq,\\alpha[n]$ 及前驱穷尽见 [[72-thm-structured-predecessor-exhaustion]]；有限链性质见 [[72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega_s,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\prec,\\preccurlyeq,\\alpha[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\Omega_s\\setminus\\{\\mathbf0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"D^\\prec_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"D^\\prec_\\alpha\\coloneqq\\{\\beta\\in\\Omega:\\beta\\prec\\alpha\\}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\alpha[n].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf0\\in D^\\prec_\\alpha,\\qquad\\forall\\beta\\in D^\\prec_\\alpha\\ (\\beta=\\mathbf0\\lor\\mathbf0\\prec\\beta),\\qquad\\forall\\beta\\in D^\\prec_\\alpha\\ (\\mathsf S\\beta\\preccurlyeq\\alpha).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\beta,\\gamma\\in D^\\prec_\\alpha\\ (\\beta=\\gamma\\lor\\beta\\prec\\gamma\\lor\\gamma\\prec\\beta).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall A\\subseteq D^\\prec_\\alpha\\ \\left(A\\ne\\varnothing\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\exists\\beta\\in A\\ \\forall\\gamma\\in A\\ \\neg(\\gamma\\prec\\beta)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\beta+1\\preccurlyeq\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha=\\mathsf S\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta=\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\prec\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha=\\mathsf L((\\alpha_i)_i)","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\preccurlyeq\\alpha_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha_i\\prec\\alpha_{i+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\prec\\alpha_{i+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf S\\beta\\preccurlyeq\\alpha_{i+1}\\prec\\alpha","display":false}],"bytes":2554,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-259","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-cor-structured-subtree-well-order|cor-structured-subtree-well-order — 结构化子树的良序]]"},{"id":"1033b4b7928c3326","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["c2a9f766f12bca93","3f09cae20e23b713"]}